		<title><![CDATA[Totnes Talks - Finlay Porter]]></title>
		<link>https://www.totnespulse.local/podcast/totnes-talks-finlay-porter/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 11:17:41 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Tony Gee]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.totnespulse.local/?post_type=podcast&#038;p=16404</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div><img class="aligncenter wp-image-18745 size-full" src="https://www.totnespulse.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ColumnHeadTonyGee.png" alt="Tony Gee Article Column" width="777" height="127" /></div>
<div></div>
<div class="elementToProof">Finlay Porter grew up around Totnes. After completing a Creative Writing degree at the University of East Anglia, Finlay travelled in a convoy of 4x4 vehicles delivering humanitarian aid to Ukraine. His most recent trip was to work with children in slum areas of Nairobi, Kenya.</div>
<div></div>
<div></div>
&nbsp;

<hr />

<div></div>
<div><img class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-16428" src="https://www.totnespulse.local/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Finlay-800x270.jpg" alt="Finlay Porter" width="800" height="270" /></div>
<div></div>
<div class="elementToProof">Finlay is a member of TQ9ers, the <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/136529853070905/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Totnes Ultimate Frisbee Club</a>.</div>
<div></div>
<div></div>
<div class="elementToProof">You can read about Finlay's Kenyan experience and other travels in his <a href="https://finlayporter.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" rel="noopener">blog here</a>.</div>
<div></div>
<div class="elementToProof">If you'd like to help get Finlay back to the Ukraine with more aid:</div>
<div class="elementToProof">this is the fundraiser link for next month's convoy to Ukraine - <a id="LPlnk578889" title="Click to open in a new window or tab https://donorbox.org/finlayukraine" href="https://donorbox.org/finlayukraine">https://donorbox.org/finlayukraine</a></div>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Finlay Porter has travelled extensively helping out in Africa and Ukraine - Tony Gee catches up with him prior to his next excursion -hopefully in a 4x4 if he can source one - to get more supplies out to Ukraine]]></excerpt:encoded>
